---
permalink: /_redirects
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
# Netlify redirects, generated at build time. Old WordPress addresses → their place on the new site.

# Old pages (none kept): homepage
{%- for path in legacyPages %}
{{ path }}  /  301
{%- endfor %}

# WordPress short links: /?p=123 → the article. (Netlify keeps the query string, which is harmless:
# each article declares its clean address. Old /?page_id= addresses were drafts or private, so they
# get no rule: a redirect from / back to / would loop. They simply show the homepage.)
{%- for story in collections.stories %}{% if story.data.wpId %}
/  p={{ story.data.wpId }}  {{ story.url }}  301!
{%- endif %}{% endfor %}

# WordPress listings
/category/*  /stories/  301
/tag/*  /stories/  301
/author/*  /stories/  301
/feed/*  /  301
/comments/feed/*  /  301
/page/:n/  /stories/page/:n/  301
/:year/:month/:day/:slug/feed/*  /:year/:month/:day/:slug/  301
/:year/:month/:day/:slug/amp/*  /:year/:month/:day/:slug/  301

# Old image addresses → new WebP files
{%- for old, webp in legacyImages %}
{{ old }}  {{ webp }}  301
{%- endfor %}
